### UMKM-in Backend API Testing File
### Gunakan ekstensi "REST Client" atau "Thunder Client" di VS Code untuk mengeksekusi request ini langsung.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 2. Register Akun Baru
# Setelah request ini dijalankan, cek terminal backend untuk melihat kode [DEV OTP]
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Ayu Lestari",
  "email": "ayu.lestari@example.com",
  "password": "PasswordRahasia123!"
}

### 3. Verifikasi OTP Email
# Masukkan kode OTP 6 digit yang tercetak di terminal backend
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ayu.lestari@example.com",
  "otp_code": "123456"
}

### 4. Kirim Ulang Kode OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ayu.lestari@example.com"
}

### 5. Login Akun Manual
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email_or_username": "ayu.lestari@example.com",
  "password": "PasswordRahasia123!"
}

### 6. Ambil Profil Saya (Protected - Wajib Sertakan Token JWT)
# Salin token dari respon login/verify-otp ke header Authorization di bawah:
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Perbarui Profil / Onboarding (Protected)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ayu_dapur",
  "full_name": "Ayu Lestari - Dapur Bunda",
  "phone_number": "6281234567890",
  "bio": "Menjual aneka camilan dan kue rumahan khas Bandung.",
  "city": "Bandung, Jawa Barat",
  "address_detail": "Jl. Cihampelas No. 12, Bandung",
  "latitude": -6.899201,
  "longitude": 107.604212,
  "avatar_url": "https://storage.umkm-in.id/avatars/ayu.jpg"
}

### 8. Ambil Seluruh Kategori Produk
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### 9. Tambah Produk Baru (Protected)
# Wajib sertakan token login seller
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_id": 1,
  "name": "Kue Gula Aren Rumahan",
  "description": "Kue gula aren buatan rumahan dengan bahan pilihan segar setiap hari.",
  "price": 35000,
  "unit": "box",
  "raw_image_url": "https://storage.umkm-in.id/products/raw-1.jpg",
  "studio_image_url": "https://storage.umkm-in.id/products/studio-1.jpg",
  "is_available": true
}

### 10. Ambil Feed Produk (Publik / Optional Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=10

### 11. Ambil Feed Produk dengan Filter Kategori & Pencarian
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?category=makanan&search=gula&sort=cheapest

### 12. Ambil Detail Produk berdasarkan UUID (Publik / Optional Auth)
# Ganti UUID berikut dengan id produk yang didapatkan dari response pembuatan produk
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### 13. Perbarui Data Produk (Protected - Hanya Pemilik)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kue Gula Aren Premium Spesial",
  "description": "Kue gula aren premium resep turun temurun.",
  "price": 38000,
  "unit": "box",
  "is_available": true
}

### 14. Hapus Produk dari Etalase (Protected - Hanya Pemilik)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 15. Ambil Daftar Komentar Produk (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/comments

### 16. Kirim Komentar Baru pada Produk (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Bisa kirim ke area Buah Batu Bandung nggak kak?",
  "parent_id": null
}

### 17. Balas Komentar yang Sudah Ada (Protected - Nested Reply)
@parentCommentId = 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Bisa kak, kami pakai kurir instan!",
  "parent_id": {{parentCommentId}}
}

### 18. Edit Komentar Sendiri (Protected - Hanya Pembuat Komentar)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/comments/{{parentCommentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Bisa kirim ke area Buah Batu Bandung besok pagi nggak kak?"
}

### 19. Hapus Komentar (Protected - Pembuat Komentar atau Pemilik Toko)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/comments/{{parentCommentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 20. Toggle Suka / Like Produk (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
